---
import Layout from '../layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Learn how we collect, use, share, retain, and protect your personal information when you visit or shop with us."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-16 md:px-6 md:py-24 lg:px-8">
    <header class="text-center">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest text-text-secondary uppercase">
        Last updated September 14, 2026
      </p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-5xl leading-tight font-bold text-text">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
        Your trust matters to us. This policy explains what information we
        collect when you visit our storefront, place an order, create an
        account, or contact us, and how we handle that information throughout
        your relationship with us.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="mt-16 space-y-12 text-left text-text-secondary">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text">Information We Collect</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          We collect information you provide directly, including your name,
          email address, phone number, billing and delivery addresses, account
          credentials, order details, product preferences, and messages sent to
          our support team. When you make a purchase, payment information is
          processed by our payment provider; we receive transaction details
          needed to confirm and support your order rather than complete card
          numbers.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          We also collect limited technical information automatically, such as
          your IP address, browser and device type, pages viewed, referring
          page, approximate location, and the date and time of each visit. This
          helps us operate the storefront, understand which experiences are
          useful, and identify unusual or potentially fraudulent activity.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text">
          How We Use Your Information
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          We use personal information to provide the products and services you
          request. This includes processing orders, arranging delivery, sending
          confirmations and service messages, maintaining your account, handling
          returns, responding to questions, and keeping an accurate record of
          our transactions with you.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          We may also use information to improve our catalog and website,
          troubleshoot technical issues, protect customers and our business,
          meet accounting and legal obligations, and measure the effectiveness
          of our communications. Where required, we ask for consent before
          sending promotional messages, and every marketing email includes a way
          to opt out.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text">
          How We Share Your Information
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          We share information only when it is needed to run the store or meet a
          legal obligation. Service providers may process information on our
          behalf for payments, hosting, analytics, customer support, email
          delivery, fraud prevention, warehousing, and shipping. They are
          expected to use it only for the services they provide to us and to
          protect it appropriately.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          We may disclose information when required by law, to respond to lawful
          requests, or to protect the rights and safety of our customers, team,
          and business. If the business is involved in a merger, acquisition,
          financing, or sale, relevant information may transfer as part of that
          transaction. We do not sell personal information for money.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text">
          Cookies and Similar Technologies
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          Cookies and similar technologies help remember your cart and
          preferences, keep accounts secure, understand storefront performance,
          and diagnose errors. Some are necessary for the website to work, while
          analytics or advertising technologies may be optional depending on
          your location. You can control cookies through available consent
          controls and your browser settings, although disabling essential
          cookies may prevent parts of the store from functioning correctly.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text">Data Retention</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          We keep personal information only as long as reasonably necessary for
          the purpose for which it was collected. Retention periods vary based
          on account activity, order and support history, warranty needs, fraud
          prevention, and tax, accounting, or other legal requirements. When
          information is no longer needed, we delete it, anonymize it, or
          securely isolate it until deletion is possible. Backup copies may
          remain for a limited period under our normal recovery procedures.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text">Your Privacy Rights</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          Depending on where you live, you may have the right to request access
          to personal information we hold about you, correct inaccurate
          information, request deletion or a portable copy, restrict or object
          to certain processing, or withdraw consent. You may also opt out of
          marketing at any time without affecting service messages related to an
          order.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          To make a request, contact us using the link below and describe what
          you need. We may ask for information to verify your identity and
          protect your account. We will respond within the period required by
          applicable law and explain if an exception prevents us from fulfilling
          all or part of a request.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text">Data Security</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          We use administrative, technical, and physical safeguards designed to
          protect personal information against loss, misuse, unauthorized
          access, alteration, and disclosure. No online service or transmission
          method can guarantee absolute security, so we also encourage you to
          use a unique password, keep account credentials private, and contact
          us promptly if you believe your account has been compromised.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text">
          Changes to This Privacy Policy
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          We may update this policy as our services, providers, or legal
          obligations change. The latest version will always appear on this page
          with its effective date. If a change materially affects how we use
          personal information, we will provide additional notice where
          appropriate, such as through the storefront or by email.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 rounded-2xl bg-surface p-8 text-center md:p-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text">
        Questions about your privacy?
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
        Contact us if you have a question about this policy or want to exercise
        a privacy right.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="mt-8 inline-block rounded-md bg-action px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-action-hover"
      >
        Get in Touch
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
